menu "DMR device probe (standalone only)"
    config DMR_PROBE_SECONDS
        int "Synthetic 48 kS/s processing run duration, seconds"
        range 5 120
        default 30
        help
            No radio or USB driver is initialized. The worker benchmarks
            only synthetic precomputed IQ via the actual D1 portable receiver.

    config DMR_PROBE_PSRAM
        bool "Allocate probe receiver, SPSC queue and IQ stimulus in PSRAM"
        default y
        help
            Prevent synthetic probe buffers from consuming the scarce DMA-
            capable internal heap. For internal-only comparison, explicitly
            disable this and verify free internal RAM before starting.

    config DMR_PROBE_FORCE_OVERLOAD
        bool "Intentionally pause probe worker for 100 ms at midpoint"
        default n
        help
            Generates measured queue drops; MUST NOT be used to claim normal
            sustained 48 kS/s acceptance.
endmenu
